{"word": "render", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To cause something to be in a particular state, or to give it formal expression.", "example": "A single missing page rendered the whole document useless.", "translation_he": "להפוך ל-, לגרום למצב"}
{"word": "repel", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To drive something back, or to cause strong dislike.", "example": "The coating repels water without adding any measurable weight.", "translation_he": "לדחות, להדוף"}
{"word": "resent", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To feel bitter about something regarded as unfair.", "example": "Junior staff resented a rule that applied only to them.", "translation_he": "לטנוא, לחוש מרירות כלפי"}
