{"word": "revere", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To respect and admire someone deeply.", "example": "He is revered in the discipline he spent forty years quietly rebuilding.", "translation_he": "להעריץ, לרחוש כבוד עמוק"}
{"word": "speculate", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To form a theory without firm evidence, or to invest at high risk.", "example": "We can only speculate about why the records were destroyed.", "translation_he": "לשער, להעלות השערות"}
{"word": "squander", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To waste money, time or an opportunity carelessly.", "example": "They squandered a two-year lead by refusing to publish.", "translation_he": "לבזבז, להחמיץ"}
{"word": "suffice", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To be enough for a purpose.", "example": "A short note will suffice; the full report is not needed.", "translation_he": "להספיק"}
{"word": "contest", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To formally dispute a decision or claim.", "example": "Two of the findings were contested and later withdrawn.", "translation_he": "לערער על, לחלוק"}
{"word": "crumble", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To break into small pieces, or to fail gradually.", "example": "Support for the proposal crumbled once the costs were published.", "translation_he": "להתפורר, לקרוס בהדרגה"}
{"word": "daunt", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To make someone lose confidence before a difficult task.", "example": "The length of the reading list daunts most first-year students.", "translation_he": "להרתיע"}
{"word": "dismay", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To fill someone with worry and disappointment.", "example": "It dismayed her to find the same error in the third edition.", "translation_he": "להדאיג, לאכזב קשות"}
{"word": "expire", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To come to an end after a fixed period of validity.", "example": "The section ends when the clock expires, whether or not you have finished.", "translation_he": "לפוג, להסתיים"}
