{"word": "reassure", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To remove someone's doubt or worry.", "example": "The supervisor reassured her that a failed replication is not a failed career.", "translation_he": "להרגיע, להפיג חשש"}
{"word": "torment", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To cause someone severe and prolonged suffering.", "example": "The unresolved question tormented him for the rest of his life.", "translation_he": "לענות, לייסר"}
