{"word": "flatter", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "To praise someone excessively, often insincerely.", "example": "He flattered the committee and got nothing he asked for.", "translation_he": "להחניף"}
{"word": "bureaucratic", "pos": "adjective", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "Involving many official rules and procedures, often slowing things down.", "example": "The delay was bureaucratic, not technical.", "translation_he": "ביורוקרטי"}
