{"word": "criteria", "pos": "noun", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "The standards by which something is judged or decided.", "example": "Each proposal is measured against the same four criteria.", "translation_he": "קריטריונים, אמות מידה"}
{"word": "diversity", "pos": "noun", "cefr": "C1", "definition_en": "The presence of a wide range of different types within a group.", "example": "The diversity of the sample is what makes the finding generalisable.", "translation_he": "גיוון, מגוון"}
