{"word": "broaden", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "B2", "definition_en": "To make something wider or more general in scope.", "example": "Reading outside the syllabus broadens vocabulary faster than drilling it.", "translation_he": "להרחיב"}
{"word": "confess", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "B2", "definition_en": "To admit something one is reluctant to reveal.", "example": "He confessed that he had never read the paper he was citing.", "translation_he": "להודות, להתוודות"}
{"word": "consult", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "B2", "definition_en": "To seek information or advice from a person or source.", "example": "Consult the published guidelines rather than a prep site.", "translation_he": "להתייעץ, לעיין"}
