{"word": "demolish", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "B2", "definition_en": "To destroy a building, or to defeat an argument completely.", "example": "One counter-example demolished a theory built over twenty years.", "translation_he": "להרוס, למוטט"}
{"word": "disqualify", "pos": "verb", "cefr": "B2", "definition_en": "To remove someone from a competition or role for breaking a rule.", "example": "Late submissions are disqualified without appeal.", "translation_he": "לפסול"}
